==Battleground==
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Star Peng]] spawns.
**3 [[Cala Maria]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Ribbo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is very simple with [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Treasure]]s. If you do not have these, use at least four 75¢ meatshields and use units that can halt the [[Star Peng]]s such as [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]. Stacking [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Major Leaguer Cat]] works very well for the [[Ribbo]], and if you have [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Cat God the Great]], you can use him to synchronize the enemies. If not, then the normal [[Cat Cannon]] works.

